## Noncommercial Purposes

Only noncommercial purposes are permitted under this license. A purpose is noncommercial only when it is not primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage, monetary compensation, or anticipated commercial application.

Commercial use is not permitted, whether or not users are charged. Examples include selling or licensing products incorporating the software; paid hosting, SaaS, consulting, integration, support, or training based on it; advertising-supported or revenue-generating deployment; use in a business's internal operations; and research or development intended to support a commercial product, service, or business advantage. Calling an activity "research", "evaluation", or "internal use" does not exempt it.

Commercial use requires a separate written agreement with the relevant rightsholder before that use begins. This license does not promise that such an agreement will be offered.

